+---
+id: task-001-fix-product-code-matching-free-shipping-threshold-and-vat-rounding
+type: task
+title: "Fix product code matching, free shipping threshold, and VAT rounding"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Request
+
+Correct three order-service behaviors reported by sales, a customer, and accounting:
+
+- Product lookup must accept SKUs with the same case-insensitive, whitespace-tolerant behavior as
+  product creation and the documented business rule.
+- Shipping must be free when discounted goods total exactly €50.00, as well as above that amount.
+- Each product line's VAT must round half up to the cent. For example, €1.99 at 22% is €0.44.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Looking up `lb-220` finds the same product as `LB-220`.
+- Discounted goods of 5,000 cents or more incur no shipping charge.
+- Line VAT is computed with the documented half-up rounding rule, not truncation.
